{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19646","headline":"白云起封中诗 · 吕温","name":"白云起封中诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"封开白云起，汉帝坐斋宫。\n望在泥金上，疑生秘玉中。\n攒柯初缭绕，布叶渐蒙笼。\n日观祥光合，天门瑞气通。\n无心已出岫，有势欲凌风。\n倘遣成膏泽，从兹遍大空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19646.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19646","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}